database · hono-drizzle
  src/shared/database.ts
  → Set `DATABASE_URL` to your PostgreSQL connection string.
  → Point drizzle-kit at your tables in `drizzle.config.ts` with `export default defineConfig({ dialect: "postgresql", schema: "./src/**/*.table.ts", dbCredentials: { url: process.env.DATABASE_URL! } })`, importing `defineConfig` from `drizzle-kit`.
