database · hono-prisma
  src/shared/database.ts
  → Set `DATABASE_URL` to your PostgreSQL connection string.
  → Generate the client where `src/shared/database.ts` imports it, with `provider = "prisma-client"` and `output = "../src/generated/prisma"` in the generator of `prisma/schema.prisma`, as `prisma init` writes it, then run `prisma generate`.
