database · axum
  src/database.rs
  → Set `DATABASE_URL` to your PostgreSQL connection string.
  → Declare the module with `mod database;` in `src/main.rs`.
  → Enable the sqlx features the code uses with `cargo add sqlx --features runtime-tokio,tls-rustls,postgres,uuid,chrono`.
  → Connect in `main` with `database::connect().await` and give the `PgPool` to your repositories.
